1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:01,879
Don't know what to get an RV guy?

2
00:00:02,039 --> 00:00:05,499
I've solved it. He loves that RV more than I want to admit.

3
00:00:05,579 --> 00:00:10,819
So this year, I looked for something he'd actually appreciate. Not just some gadget that ends up in a drawer.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,019
I found a roof cover for the RV.

5
00:00:13,099 --> 00:00:19,260
It protects the roof all winter outside. He was genuinely happy—not politely happy, truly thrilled.

6
00:00:19,359 --> 00:00:23,920
For once, I gave him something he actually uses every winter, year after year.

7
00:00:23,979 --> 00:00:27,619
The best gift is the one that shows you get what they care about.
